sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Staff user
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>Web: Email and password, sign in
    Web->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>DB: check password and account status, create session
    API->>DB: resolveUserAccess - ownerships, active portal assignments, active orgs and locations
    API-->>Web: access token 15 min, refresh cookie 1 day or 30 days, organizations, selection flags
    alt exactly one organization with one location
        Web->>Web: store active organization and location
    else several organizations or locations, or a super admin
        Web->>User: /select-location - Select Organization, then Select Location
        User->>Web: pick a location, Continue
        Web->>API: POST /auth/select-location
        API->>DB: validateAccess, save last accessed organization and location
        API-->>Web: active organization and location ids
    end
    Web->>API: GET /me/access with x-organization-id and x-location-id
    API-->>Web: permissions, features, roles, home page
    Web-->>User: open the home page of the role
    User->>Web: later - pick another location in the location switcher
    Web->>API: POST /auth/switch-location
    API->>DB: validateAccess, save last accessed
    API-->>Web: new active ids
    Web->>Web: invalidate every cached query, access is fetched again
